  m_Name: Trade Office Reminder
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Trade Office Reminder
  content: "Trade Office Reminder\n\nAll merchants are reminded to:\n\u2022 Renew
    caravan permits before departure.\n\u2022 Declare high-value cargo at inspection.\n\u2022
    Report damaged road markers to the Wayfinders' Guild.\n\u2022 Be courteous to
    inspectors.\n\nThe inspectors are trying their best, too.\n\u2014 Yssa Ward\n\n(Someone
    wrote underneath.)\n\"Depends which inspector.\"\n(The comment has been crossed
    out.)"
